  "elements": [
    {
      "id": "jHI3rNUgaYsGkRzpI6C7d",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 401.2236721084064,
      "y": -310.93671623875946,
      "width": 896.2890625,
      "height": 2750,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bBZ",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1439074211,
      "version": 2138,
      "versionNonce": 1430878371,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1742896556701,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Design Tinder\n\nFunctional requirements:\n\n1. User can create profile and set preferences\n2. Get recommendations of profiles\n3. Swipe left/right on a profile\n\nout of scope:\n1. Chats\n2. Premium subscription\n3. Flight mode\n\nNon functional requirements:\n\n1. High availability - matches and swipes\n2. Consistency \n    - user1 rights wiped user2 \n    - user2 right swipes user1: instant notification\n3. Scalability: 100M DAU \n4. Low latency (< 100ms)\n\n\nBack of the envelope calculation:\n\n1. 100M DAU\nwrites: 100M * 100 -> 10^9/10^5 ~ 10k TPS \nreads: 2k TPS\n\n2. Storage\ncache -> 10^9 * 10 B -> 10GB -> 365 * 10 -> 3.6 TB\n\n\nCore entities:\n\n1. Profile\nprofileId: UUID\nname: varchar(200)\ndob: timestamp\nmaxAgePref: number\nminAgePref: number\nmaxDistancePref: number\ngenderPref: Gender(MALE, FEMALE)\ncurrentLocation: Location (lat, long)\nhobbies\nprofileDescription\nupdatedAt: timestamp\n\n2. PhotoMetadata\nphotoId\nfileUrl\nprofileId\n\nPK -> \"PHOTO#123\"\nSK -> \"FORMAT#PNG\"\ntype -> photo or format\nformat -> PNG\n\n240x480 -> PNG\n360x720 -> JPG\n\n3. Request\nrequestId\nuser1: FK, Profile\nuser2: FK, Profile\nuser1Decision: RequestStatus (LEFt, RIGHT)\nuser2Decision: RequestStatus (LEFt, RIGHT)\ncreatedAt: timestamp\n\nAPIs:\n\n1. GET /api/v1/profiles?page=1&limit=20&location=Location\nRequest header -> JWT token -> profileId\n\nResponse -> \n{\n    \"profiles\": [\n    {\n        \"profileId\"\n        \"age\",\n        \"profileDescription'\n    }\n    ]\n}\n\n2. POST /api/v1/swipe/{profileId}\nRequest body -> \n{\n    \"swipeDecision\": \"left\" | \"right\"\n}\n\n3. POST /api/v1/profile\n\nrequest body ->\n{\n    \"name\": \"\",\n    \"age\": \"\",\n    \"profileDescrip\",\n    \"currentLocation\"\n}\n\nResponse -> Profile with profileId\n\n4. PUT /api/v1/profile/{profileId}\n{\n    \"maxAge\": \"\",\n    \"minAge\": \"\",\n}\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Design Tinder\n\nFunctional requirements:\n\n1. User can create profile and set preferences\n2. Get recommendations of profiles\n3. Swipe left/right on a profile\n\nout of scope:\n1. Chats\n2. Premium subscription\n3. Flight mode\n\nNon functional requirements:\n\n1. High availability - matches and swipes\n2. Consistency \n    - user1 rights wiped user2 \n    - user2 right swipes user1: instant notification\n3. Scalability: 100M DAU \n4. Low latency (< 100ms)\n\n\nBack of the envelope calculation:\n\n1. 100M DAU\nwrites: 100M * 100 -> 10^9/10^5 ~ 10k TPS \nreads: 2k TPS\n\n2. Storage\ncache -> 10^9 * 10 B -> 10GB -> 365 * 10 -> 3.6 TB\n\n\nCore entities:\n\n1. Profile\nprofileId: UUID\nname: varchar(200)\ndob: timestamp\nmaxAgePref: number\nminAgePref: number\nmaxDistancePref: number\ngenderPref: Gender(MALE, FEMALE)\ncurrentLocation: Location (lat, long)\nhobbies\nprofileDescription\nupdatedAt: timestamp\n\n2. PhotoMetadata\nphotoId\nfileUrl\nprofileId\n\nPK -> \"PHOTO#123\"\nSK -> \"FORMAT#PNG\"\ntype -> photo or format\nformat -> PNG\n\n240x480 -> PNG\n360x720 -> JPG\n\n3. Request\nrequestId\nuser1: FK, Profile\nuser2: FK, Profile\nuser1Decision: RequestStatus (LEFt, RIGHT)\nuser2Decision: RequestStatus (LEFt, RIGHT)\ncreatedAt: timestamp\n\nAPIs:\n\n1. GET /api/v1/profiles?page=1&limit=20&location=Location\nRequest header -> JWT token -> profileId\n\nResponse -> \n{\n    \"profiles\": [\n    {\n        \"profileId\"\n        \"age\",\n        \"profileDescription'\n    }\n    ]\n}\n\n2. POST /api/v1/swipe/{profileId}\nRequest body -> \n{\n    \"swipeDecision\": \"left\" | \"right\"\n}\n\n3. POST /api/v1/profile\n\nrequest body ->\n{\n    \"name\": \"\",\n    \"age\": \"\",\n    \"profileDescrip\",\n    \"currentLocation\"\n}\n\nResponse -> Profile with profileId\n\n4. PUT /api/v1/profile/{profileId}\n{\n    \"maxAge\": \"\",\n    \"minAge\": \"\",\n}\n\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
